NAME
    processes - Read permitted process information.

SYNOPSIS
    processes | process

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Runs as an isolated userland command and issues Get(command.processes.get). The kernel returns only process information permitted to the calling process; this command is not a process-control administration interface.

ALIASES
    process

FILES
    /System/Commands/PROCESS.CMD
    /INU/HELP/PROCESS.MAN
